	JMP FORLP	/GO CHECK LIMIT AGAIN
UNFOR,	.-.		/SUBROUTINE TO UNSTACK 'FOR' INFO
	TAD PDLPTR	/GET STACK POINTER
	DCA WORK	/SAVE IN CASE NEED TO GO AGAIN
	JMS I POPF	/UNSTACK
	GETPTR		/DECODE INFO
	JMS I POPF	/UNSTACK
	DUMMY		/LIMIT
	JMS I POPF	/UNSTACK
