	JMP TABIT	/NO, GO AHEAD
	CLA 		/YES, CLEAR JUNK
	TAD CR		/GET A CARRIAGE RETURN
	JMS I TYP	/PRINT WITHOUT LINE FEED
	JMS I TYP	/PINT NUL FOR DELAY
