	DCA WRKPTR	/SET UP POINTER INTO TABLE
SCHLP,	TAD I WRKPTR	/GET CHARACTER FROM TABLE
	SPA 		/END OF TABLE?
	JMP SCHXIT	/YES, TAKE 'NOT FOUND' RETURN
	TAD WORK	/NO, SUBTRACT CHARACTER
